    "author": null,
    "content": "<p>Pilots on the Wild Ten have lots to contend with&mdash;gunfire, explosions, and even environmental damage, but we think you deserve even more mayhem. Have you ever been in the middle of fighting for a Warp Gate and started to get blurry vision or even get a warning to plug in your mech? No? Well, now you will!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Introducing Pilot &amp; War Robot Damage Debuffs, coming <strong>June 31! </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This new feature, known as <strong>Faulty Operational Overload Logic System (F.O.O.L.S)</strong>, will add debuffs to your Pilot and War Robot, making battles even more realistic the more damage you take!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/04/192-F.O.O.L.S/Website_Body_1200x675.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Vertigo</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Battling in a War Robot can take its toll on even the hardiest of Pilots. Fight to stay in control with the new <strong>Vertigo </strong>debuff as it becomes harder and harder to stay on course!</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IJBxkdaMfhQ\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/IJBxkdaMfhQ?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=cyXwm\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Concussion&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shoot, dodge, jump! Wait&hellip;where am I? The new <strong>Concussion </strong>debuff adds all the fun of being utterly confused to the battlefield!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oVK_N8SJyxE\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/oVK_N8SJyxE?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=y58QN\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Low Battery</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Did you forget to plug in your War Robot before bed again? The new <strong>Low Battery</strong> debuff adds technological realism to your battles, and reminds you to always leave the house with a spare portable charger.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jlMqvJoGB08\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/jlMqvJoGB08?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=Gi769\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Damage Assessment</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Diagnostics never rest! The new<strong> Damage Assessment </strong>effect will help you to better understand the ins and outs of how your War Robot works. It takes a while though&hellip;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mg2Zi4mpYO8\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/mg2Zi4mpYO8?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=HgDat\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Overheat</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Staying cool in the heat of battle sometimes simply isn&rsquo;t possible. Feel the heat with the new <strong>Overheat </strong>effect, taking you to new highs (temperatures, that is).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0VF5NnXzMbI\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/0VF5NnXzMbI?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=Ttyh9\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 7px;\">Happy April Fools Day!</p>",
